    "video_id": "l7Y-AF-Zt0Y"
   },
   {
    "context": "When you're inundated by the amount of propaganda that we are, it can be difficult to keep things straight or to understand what is right. And I think that's something that both American atheists and American humanists do really well is helps to create in person communities where people can live with, think with, love with, work with people who all have a strong interest in showing and living humanist values every day.",
